      "title": "Energy Meter & Utility Device Integration",
      "desc": "Enables seamless connectivity with energy meters and utility devices to collect and transmit real-time consumption, voltage, and power-quality data. This supports centralized monitoring, accurate energy tracking, and more informed utility management."
    },
    {
      "title": "Building Automation Connectivity",
      "desc": "Connects HVAC systems, lighting, access control, and other building management equipment over a unified network. This enables centralized monitoring and control of building operations, improving energy efficiency, security, and overall operational convenience."
    },
    {
      "title": "Legacy Device Network Enablement",
      "desc": "Bridges older equipment and legacy systems with modern IP networks, enabling continued communication without requiring a complete infrastructure upgrade. This helps extend existing asset life while simplifying centralized monitoring and management."
    }
